# Search scope for ripgrep-based tools (rg, editor and agent search). These paths stay tracked; they are
# data, build outputs or evidence whose hits bury source results, and several are single lines of 2-13 MB.
# To search one anyway, name the file (`rg pattern assets/ships/yamato/blueprint.json`) or pass --no-ignore.
public/models/
assets/reviews/
assets/**/reports/
assets/**/references/
assets/**/review/
assets/ships/*/blueprint.json
assets/ships/*/generated/
assets/ships/*/baseline/
assets/gameplay/hydrostatics.v1.json
vendor/*/build/
src/ships/presetCatalog.json
src/ships/*.generated.json
src/simulation/fixtures/
src/generated/
docs/archive/
docs/**/*.html
*.lock
